r identified YBX1 phosphorylation, downstream of the PI3K/mTOR pathway, restrains basal-like cancer cell proliferation. In contrast, YBX1 acts as a safeguard against the proliferation-to-invasion switch in mesenchymal-like epithelial cancer cells, and its loss accentuates partial-EMT and in vivo invasion. Interestingly, phospho-YBX1 that is mutually exclusive to partial-EMT, emerged as a prognostic marker for overall patient outcomes.      Expression profiling by high throughputsequencing were performed to explore the underlying molecular mechanisms.","gpl":"18573","gse":"226355","taxon":"Homo sapiens","entrytype":"GSE","gdstype":"Expression profiling by high throughput sequencing","ptechtype":"","valtype":"","ssinfo":"","subsetinfo":"","pdat":"2023/03/03","suppfile":"TXT","samples":[{"accession":"GSM7073833","title":"OKF6, rep 2 [RNA-seq]"},{"accession":"GSM7073836","title":"SCC15, YBX1KO, DOXneg, rep 2 [RNA-seq]"},{"accession":"GSM7073839","title":"SCC15, YBX1KO, DOXpos, rep 2 [RNA-seq]"},{"accession":"GSM7073842","title":"SCC25, YBX1KO, DOXneg, rep 2 [RNA-seq]"},{"accession":"GSM7073845","title":"SCC25, YBX1KO, DOXpos, rep 2 [RNA-seq]"},{"accession":"GSM7073834","title":"OKF6, rep 3 [RNA-seq]"},{"accession":"GSM7073846","title":"SCC25, YBX1KO, DOXpos, rep 3 [RNA-seq]"},{"accession":"GSM7073837","title":"SCC15, YBX1KO, DOXneg, rep 3 [RNA-seq]"},{"accession":"GSM7073835","title":"SCC15, YBX1KO, DOXneg, rep 1 [RNA-seq]"},{"accession":"GSM7073840","title":"SCC15, YBX1KO, DOXpos, rep 3 [RNA-seq]"},{"accession":"GSM7073843","title":"SCC25, YBX1KO, DOXneg, rep 3 [RNA-seq]"},{"accession":"GSM7073832","title":"OKF6, rep 1 [RNA-seq]"},{"accession":"GSM7073844","title":"SCC25, YBX1KO, DOXpos, rep 1 [RNA-seq]"},{"accession":"GSM7073838","title":"SCC15, YBX1KO, DOXpos, rep 1 [RNA-seq]"},{"accession":"GSM7073841","title":"SCC25, YBX1KO, DOXneg, rep 1 [RNA-seq]"}],"relations":[],"extrelations":[],"n_samples":15,"seriestitle":"","platformtitle":"","platformtaxa":"","samplestaxa"